WEBVTT

00:00:01.031 --> 00:00:04.047
Before the flight: check data, payment and the first ride.

00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:07.141
Visual tutorials: one actionable step at a time.

00:00:07.156 --> 00:00:09.172
Follow a concrete step through an unfamiliar interface.

00:00:09.281 --> 00:00:11.281
Choose a payment method: Alipay or TenPayGo.

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:17.125
Payment verification flow. This transaction is simulated.

00:00:17.156 --> 00:00:19.156
One payment method is ready; the other can be a backup.

00:00:20.484 --> 00:00:22.484
A simulated arrival opens the landing check.

00:00:22.578 --> 00:00:25.594
First on arrival: get connected.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.625
Find the airport Wi-Fi sign-in route that fits.

00:00:28.656 --> 00:00:31.656
Review transport choices for the arrival conditions.

00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:34.734
Show the Chinese hotel address to the driver.

00:00:34.844 --> 00:00:37.844
Prototype walkthrough: payments, flights and trip data are simulated.
